OL,3,GNEWSAPolice say fire at derelict
OL,4,AGlasgow nightclub was started
OL,5,Adeliberately
OL,6,
OL,7,FPolice believe a blaze in a derelict
OL,8,Fnightclub in Glasgow city centre which
OL,9,Ffire crews spent the night tackling was
OL,10,Fstarted deliberately.
OL,12,FThe alarm was raised at the former
OL,13,FJumpin' Jaks on Sauchiehall Street
OL,14,Fabout 01:36.
OL,16,FPolice Scotland said Dalhousie Street
OL,17,Fwas closed between Renfrew Street and
OL,18,FSauchiehall Street before reopening at
OL,19,Fabout18:00.
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
