OL,5,Adeliberately
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Scottish Fire and Rescue Service
OL,8,F(SFRS) said it mobilised nine
OL,9,Fappliances, one height appliance and
OL,10,Fthree specialist resources to the
OL,11,Fscene.
